1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,000
Meet IBD Aide — a private companion for
Crohn's disease and ulcerative colitis.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,400
Free, with no ads and no accounts.
Your health data never leaves your phone.

3
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:11,200
Log symptoms in seconds with the
Bristol quick-tap, pain, and mood.

4
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:14,800
Your daily HBI or SCCAI score is computed
automatically — ready to discuss with your care team.

5
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,600
Trends reveal flare patterns early,
compared against your own baseline.

6
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:22,200
It even correlates foods you ate
with symptom spikes 4 to 48 hours later.

7
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:26,000
Scan a barcode or photograph a dish
before you eat.

8
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,600
Ingredients are checked on your phone against
Crohn's & Colitis Foundation and IOIBD guidance.

9
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:33,400
Track IV infusions, appointments, meds,
and colonoscopy prep — with reminders.

10
00:00:33,400 --> 00:00:37,000
Capture questions for your doctor
the moment you think of them.

11
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:40,800
Generate a clean PDF summary
and share it with your doctor yourself.

12
00:00:40,800 --> 00:00:44,400
Everything stays encrypted on your iPhone —
no accounts, no analytics, no ads.

13
00:00:44,600 --> 00:00:48,600
IBD Aide is free on the App Store.

14
00:00:48,600 --> 00:00:53,200
Not a medical device — always consult
your healthcare team. Full citations in the app.
